84 < 2 run mechanics, none affecting engine measurement: transcript-path `%`-precedence
85 < 2 crash + integration-branch diffing (`a7a89cc`), headless 600s bg-wait ceiling +
86 < 2 stderr-merged result JSON (`02febab`), judge verdict-JSON extraction (`9b27ebb`).
87 < 2 Engine pinning was verified per engine from session transcripts (cells resolved
