91 < 2 ## Operator decision (2026-07-10, post-diagnosis)
92 < 2 
93 < 2 The operator reviewed the miss and the diagnosis, accepted the
94 < 2 sampling-variance explanation (no causal path from the subtraction to any
95 < 2 judged defect; zero false blocks and zero redirect rounds on both engines),
96 < 2 and explicitly waived the recommended n=2 rerun for lack of time. **v0.1.0 is
97 < 2 tagged on this operator judgment, not on a formal tag-rule pass.**
